        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat exchanger, heat pump Limmatschulhaus
This data set describes the production of the heat exchanger. Data stems from questionnaire.;
UUID: 571eeed3-cbb4-3b2e-9499-8343710cb065
This data set includes energy and material requirements for the production of the heat exchanger as well as the disposal of waste water and waste.
Location: This data represent the production in Switzerland.
Technology: The heat exchanger is made from steel 1.4571 and has an exchanger surface of 80 m2. It is 100 m long.
Time period: Actual data.
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_571eeed3-cbb4-3b2e-9499-8343710cb065.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
